Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sahara is the largest hot desert on Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Its dunes can rise higher than a fifty story
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,building
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet only a few thousand years ago this land
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.67,0:00:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,was green and full of lakes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.08,0:00:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hippos and crocodiles lived where camels walk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.85,0:00:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.69,0:00:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ancient rock paintings still show the animals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,that once roamed here
